## Knowledge base (kb-kit)

This repository has an agent-maintained knowledge base at `{{KB_DIR}}/` —
plain markdown: nodes, indexes, `[[links]]`, evidence citations.

- **Before diagnosing, designing, or deciding** around any topic this repo may
  already know (recurring incidents, past decisions, clients, constraints):
  check the base first — `/kb-ask <question>` answers with verbatim citations.
- When a durable fact, decision, or client quote emerges: offer `/kb-add`.
- Hygiene `/kb-check` · semantic audit `/kb-audit` · graph `/kb-viz`.
